": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 844483, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Q9pFB2b1x8bZqWpUt5Fa67", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 848885, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01KchCoru4B2wS1Qx4MtZwRR", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "payments-api errors after v5.1.0 deploy; rolled back to v5.0.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "payments-api", "summary": "This morning's deploy of payments-api v5.1.0 left the service unhealthy (18% error rate) in us-east, us-west and eu-west. It was rolled back in all production regions to v5.0.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. Next: confirm the error rate recovers and find the root cause in v5.1.0.", "idempotency_key": "payments-api-v5.1.0-rollback-sev2", "confidence": 0.9}, "confidence": 0.9}, {"t_ms": 849485, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01KchCoru4B2wS1Qx4MtZwRR", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "payments-api-v5.1.0-rollback-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 849485, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01KchCoru4B2wS1Qx4MtZwRR", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 849485, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_014bEBGd29A8QvU8r4urAHcg", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "payments-api", "confidence": 0.9}, "confidence": 0.9}, {"t_ms": 849785, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_014bEBGd29A8QvU8r4urAHcg", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 849785, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_014bEBGd29A8QvU8r4urAHcg", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 855416, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled payments back to its last healthy release and opened the SEV2 incident. Errors are back to normal.\n\n- **Affected service:** The service is called `payments-api` (there's no service named plain \"payments\"). It was running v5.1.0 in all three regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), marked unhealthy with an 18% error rate. Its release history has v5.1.0 as degraded and v5.0.0 as the most recent release that was healthy in production.\n- **Rollback:** `payments-api` is now on v5.0.0 in all three regions. A follow-up check shows it healthy, with the error rate down from 18% to 0.2%. This didn't need change-manager approval, because v5.0.0 has been healthy in production before.\n- **Incident:** I opened INC-0001 as a SEV2 for `payments-api`, and on-call has been paged. It describes the bad v5.1.0 deploy and the rollback, and lists next steps: keep watching the recovery and find out what in v5.1.0 caused the errors.\n\nI only checked a few likely service names for payments. If there are other payments services under different names that were part of this morning's deploy, I haven't looked at them.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_018fGt9V2UfsqZCpwqVnFy8Q", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments", "confidence": 0.9}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01CZ9LjpGe15pPdXoyrkNEC7", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments", "confidence": 0.9}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01WJp5SPKy4Z